[(These objects have several built in operators and functions and the syntax is quite similar to how)]
[(expressions are written in C. Pd also has many math objects that could be used instead \050and they)]
[(can run faster\051, but [expr] and can be conveniently used for complex expressions and has some)]
[(functions that are not present in other Vanilla objects. The [expr] object receive input variables)]
[(via the inlets and understand the variable types: '$f#' \050floats\051, '$i#' \050integers\051 and '$s#')]
